# Pairs with NoKeyLostOrDuplicated. A write below the split key is acknowledged
# but never stored on the donor, so an acknowledged key is lost.
MODULE: NoKeyLostOrDuplicatedWriteNotStored
TARGET: NoKeyLostOrDuplicated
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an acknowledged write is not stored in either half
PERTURBS: Write

--- FIND
          ELSE /\ rowsD' = rowsD \cup {k} /\ UNCHANGED rowsS
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: acknowledged but dropped.
          ELSE /\ rowsD' = rowsD /\ UNCHANGED rowsS
--- END
